  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.1.0:\n- ADDED: Unlicense licence\n- ADDED: PlaidConfig.Sync (SyncSettings): include_original_description, personal_finance_category_version; Transaction.OriginalDescription\n- ADDED: Api.createUpdateLinkTokenWithFieldsAsync for extra update-mode fields (android_package_name, ...)\n- ADDED: Webhook.KeyCache with verifyCachedAsync / receiveCachedAsync\n- CHANGED: Sync.fetchChangesAsync stops after SyncSettings.MaxRestarts (default 3) mutation restarts and returns the error\n- BREAKING: new record fields PlaidConfig.Sync and Transaction.OriginalDescription; code building these records in full needs them\nv1.0.0:\n- ADDED: Link tokens (new item, update mode), public token exchange, accounts, transactions sync, refresh, item removal\n- ADDED: Sync.linkItemAsync / syncItemAsync / unlinkItemAsync / refreshItemInfoAsync over IPlaidStore\n- ADDED: webhook verification (Plaid-Verification ES256 JWT) and typed events, UK/EU and US/CA\n- ADDED: JsonFilePlaidStore and InMemoryPlaidStore for development, CSV export\n- ADDED: Api.postAsync / postRawAsync for any endpoint, Api.createLinkTokenForProductsAsync for any products",
